menu "RoboHub DS18B20 module"

config RH_BOARD_DS18B20_MODULE
    bool "DS18B20 temperature sensor breakout"
    select RH_DRV_DS18B20
    default n
    help
      The DS18B20 temperature sensor breakout. Selecting it brings in the
      driver and the 1-Wire bus and timer the breakout needs; an application
      that does not fit the module pays for none of it.

endmenu
